While you're looking at the listing, check that utils.ts is directly in src/. If it isn't, you'll get the same kind of error for '../utils' next.

Step 3: Test

Save, and the browser should reload on its own. If the error overlay is still showing, refresh the page. You should see the image grid.

Once it works, commit and push, and tell me. If a different error appears, paste it the same way. Next is the gallery filter.

